From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: SunUEFI <slwyts@tuta.io>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 23:47:20 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] fix(launcher): start Droidloom when opening Android apps

Route launches using the default desktop session through its existing systemd start job when stopped. Share setup and keep the last session mode when simultaneous launches need to start Android. Report graphical launch failures through the desktop notification service.
---
