 .../src/bin/droidloomctl.rs                   | 196 ++++++++++++------
 .../droidloom-supervisor/src/boot_notice.rs   |   6 +
 3 files changed, 149 insertions(+), 62 deletions(-)

diff --git a/docs/desktop-integration.md b/docs/desktop-integration.md
index 50aab59..8e31e4c 100644
--- a/docs/desktop-integration.md
+++ b/docs/desktop-integration.md
@@ -2,10 +2,11 @@
 
 ## Windows
 
-`droidloomctl start` and `droidloomctl stop` control the complete runtime. Startup
-is manual. The catalog exports Android launcher activities, labels and icons as
-XDG desktop applications. `droidloomctl applications` lists the catalog; launches
-require a running cell.
+`droidloomctl start` and `droidloomctl stop` control the complete runtime. The
+catalog exports Android launcher activities, labels and icons as XDG desktop
+applications. Opening an exported app starts Droidloom if it is stopped; it
+does not need to run at login. `droidloomctl applications` lists the catalog
+while Android is running.
 
 The catalog subscribes to framework package/user/locale events. It snapshots on
 connection and changes, fetches missing icons in batches, and blocks while idle.
